    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire this three-bedroom semi-detached property which extends to approximately 86 sq m (925 sq ft). ?Nirvanna? is a true gem, an ideal opportunity for one to mould and create one?s ?Forever Home?. Harnessing both the morning and afternoon sunlight, this 1973 built home is ideally positioned within the established and highly regarded Hillcourt Estate, just off Donnybrook Hill, \nWhilst modernisation would be required, ?Nirvana? offers considerable potential for the discerning purchaser to create a comfortable and contemporary family home, while the generous surrounding grounds provide an added dimension rarely available with properties of this type. Viewing is a must in order to appreciate this property to its fullest. \n\n\nOutside \nOne of 'Nirvanna's' most appealing features is its particularly private cul de sac setting and its grounds to its frond , side and rear. Its grounds can be considers a Landscapers dream, a unique opportunity to mold and shape one's ideal garden. \n\nServices \nMains Water\nMains Sewage\nElectricity Connection\nMains Gas Connection.\nRefuse Collection."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall Marley Flooring with Herring Bow Finish, Fitted Blind. \r\nSitting Room (14.44ft x 11.02ft) Marley Flooring, Feature Raised Stone Clad Fireplace with Solid Fuel Fire Place and Storage Shelving, Fitted Blind and Fitted Curtains. \r\nKitchen/Dining Room (20.83ft x 10.83ft) Fitted Floor and Eye Level Units, Plumbed for Appliances and Door to rear Gardena Area. Tiled Floor and Kitchen Area and Marley Flooring in Dining Area. \r\nStairs and Landing Timber Stair case Leading to Landing area, Hot Press/Storage Press. \r\nBedroom 1 (13.65ft x 8.86ft) Laminate Timber Flooring, Built in Wardrobe. \r\nBedroom 2 (13.65ft x 10.50ft) Laminate Timber Flooring, Built in Wardrobe.\r\nBedroom 3 (9.06ft x 7.19ft) Timber Flooring, Fitted Blind. \r\nShower Room W.C., Wash Hand Basin with Storage Unit, Corner Shower Unit with Electric shower, PVC Paneled Finish Throughout."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright Accommodation Throughout. \nSpacious Grounds On Offer.\nSouth Facing Rear Aspect. \nEnormous Potential to Further Develop. \nPeaceful Cul De Sac Location.\nConvenient to Bus Stops Etc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER G\nBER No. 110342250\n Energy Performance Indicator: 479.5 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "The property enjoys an excellent location on Donnybrook Hill in Douglas, within immediate proximity of regular bus services and bus stops, providing convenient access to Cork city and surrounding areas. Douglas village and its extensive range of amenities are within easy reach, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and other everyday conveniences. \nFrom Douglas village, proceed up Donnybrook Hill keeping straight at the junction of Donnybrook Hill and Grange Road. Pass Christys Carpets on left and continue straight for c. 300 meters. Take right turning into Hillcourt and at T Junction, take turning to left. Follow road around Right Hand Bend and this property is last on Left. See Agents Signange. Eircode:T12 DNWO"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "TJ Cronin"
      }
